                                               """Changelog:
260210 (Nicolò Pratelli)
- updated documentation
- fixed bug with R15i is fragment of
220210 (Nicolò Pratelli)
- Initial version"""@en ,
                                               """ISTI-CNR LRMoo - An OWL DL implementation of the LRMoo (formerly FRBRoo)
version 0.7, created by Digital Humanities Group at AIMH Lab at Institute of Information Science and Technologies \"Alessandro Faedo\". It is based on the Draft Version v.0.7 of LRMoo (https://www.cidoc-crm.org/frbroo/sites/default/files/LRMoo_V0.7%28draft%202021-06-29%29.pdf). This implementation is currently under development by ISTI group. The ISTI-CNR LRMoo implementation is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported License."""@en ;
                                  rdfs:isDefinedBy :ontology.ttl ;
                                  rdfs:label "CNR-ISTI LRMoo"@en ;
                                  owl:priorVersion <https://imagoarchive.it/onto/ILRMoo-100222.owl> ;
                                  owl:versionInfo "ILRMoo 100222 / LRMoo v.0.7 / ECRM 211015 / CIDOC-CRM 7.1.1"@en .

